⨯ incompatible-annotations: member `a` cannot be both @optional and @external
  @ test.idl:3:30

 2 │ struct Data {
 3 │     @optional @external long a;
   │      ˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆ  ˆˆˆˆˆˆˆˆ      ˆ incompatible annotations on member
   │      │         └─ @external annotation here
   │      └─ @optional annotation here
 4 │     @shared @optional long b;
 5 │     @optional @default(0) long c;

  ? remove either @optional or @external

